                                <string key="text">Certified assistance animals are highly trained disability support aids that play an essential role in helping individuals with disabilities to engage in daily tasks safely and confidently.                               
In many countries, travellers with an assistance animal are entitled to book any accommodation without facing additional fees or conditions even if pets aren’t allowed. Legal requirements on assistance animals vary based on location, so before travelling, study the local laws.</string>
